    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARBLES RICOCHET</strong> is an ad-free, fascinating, easy to learn game. Swipe a <strong>green marble</strong> against <strong>red marbles</strong> to remove them from the playfield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 level packs are available, each with its own difficulty rating, for a total of 1200 puzzles to solve.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARBLES RICOCHET</strong> is an ad-free, fascinating, easy to learn game. Swipe a <strong>green marble</strong> against <strong>red marbles</strong> to remove them from the playfield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 level packs are available, each with its own difficulty rating, for a total of 1200 puzzles to solve.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Swipe a green marble in the direction you want to move. Ricochet against red marbles to get them into a hole. A level is solved once all red marbles are gone. The levels in each pack can always be solved without having to buy extra power-ups or other distractions!",
